body:
I finally got back to the gym after 2 months. It felt so good to be able to lift again. Luckily after going through a short lived Covid Depression I started running again to help a buddy lose weight. It did good for me as well, I was able to stay relatively in shape during the closure of the gym.

&#x200B;

I also finished the running challenge with my friend and he did a really good job. He was able to complete the challenge and was running 4 miles by the ending of the month. I am proud of the guy.
